Feature: forge_kernel

  This repository's Prism application, in app/: decide the next build phase of a
  Hologram Forge app, and whether an origin may use an effect. FK-01 to FK-04 were
  generated by prism-code; FK-05 onward are hand-authored. FK-10 and FK-11: a reword
  (an edit that leaves the logic kappa unchanged: words, labels, the view) keeps the phase.

  @FK-01 @build
  Scenario: The app never answers proved when phase is not proved and event is not attest
    Given the model in app/src/ForgeKernel.lex.tex
    When the Lean kernel checks inv001Holds during prismpm verify
    Then no request meets breaksInv001

  @FK-02 @build
  Scenario: The app never answers published when phase is not proved and phase is not published
    Given the model in app/src/ForgeKernel.lex.tex
    When the Lean kernel checks inv002Holds during prismpm verify
    Then no request meets breaksInv002

